        text: "Sunil played barefoot football on the muddy ground behind his village school. His boots were torn, so he practised with borrowed shoes two sizes large. The coach noticed his speed and gave him old studs from the sports room. In the district final it rained heavily, and the ground turned to slippery mud. In the last minute Sunil ran past two defenders and scored the winning goal. The whole village lifted him on their shoulders. Hard practice and one kind coach had changed a barefoot boy into a district hero.",
